      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I, Titicupe, esteemed manager of the Toy Factory and genius inventor, has done it again! I've just created the world's most sophisticated vending machine!",
      "translation" : "我，玩具工厂经理兼天才发明家提提库佩，又成功了！我刚刚发明了世界上最先进的自动贩卖机！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk to him about the Vending Machine",
      "translation" : "询问自动贩卖机"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
