      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Titicupe]",
      "translation" : "[提提库佩]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you see the little snowman to the left side of me? Can you? If you look at his mouth closely, you'll see that it's been built quite largely. You might say, a bit too large for normal purposes...",
      "translation" : "你看到我左边那个小雪人了吗？仔细看看它的嘴，会发现嘴巴造得特别大。可以说，大得有点不太正常..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Titicupe]",
      "translation" : "[提提库佩]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You see, that snowman is actually an amazing vending machine that I invented out of my blood, sweat, tears and snow.",
      "translation" : "其实，那个雪人就是我发明的超棒自动贩卖机，倾注了我的心血、汗水、泪水，还有雪。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Titicupe]",
      "translation" : "[提提库佩]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You can put all sorts of things inside its mouth, and if you insert the right items, you'll get some hats in return...",
      "translation" : "你可以把各种东西放进它嘴里。放入正确的物品，就能换到帽子..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Titicupe]",
      "translation" : "[提提库佩]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Fashionable hats that you've always dreamed of wearing...! Bwahahahaha~!",
      "translation" : "你一直梦想戴上的时尚帽子...！哇哈哈哈哈~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Titicupe]",
      "translation" : "[提提库佩]"
